<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal fell to 766,852 tonnes in the week to March 18 from 927,651 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Just over half the liftings, 411,679 tonnes, went to British and French refineries.</p>
